# Local secrets for the va:forms:* tooling. Copy the keys you need into a
# git-ignored .env (shared) and/or .env.dev / .env.prod (per project). A real
# exported shell variable always wins over these files.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.dev    # then paste your sandbox key below
#
# The VA Forms API is open data (public form metadata, no PII). A sandbox key
# (immediate, no approval) works with the --sandbox flag against sandbox-api.va.gov.
# A production key works without --sandbox against api.va.gov.

VA_FORMS_API_KEY=your-va-forms-api-key
